{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間周四，全球首富、SpaceX和特斯拉公司創始人埃隆·馬斯克表示，<strong>他將每年向美國所有孩子再捐贈一股SpaceX股份</strong>。「今後每年，我都會向美國所有的孩子再捐贈一股SpaceX股票。」馬斯克在社交平台X上表示。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588162.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.355975+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:18:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_hash":"34ddbb95414defd46bcb854473d18a1a6178e27fc58d2a9ab71d87503683076c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}